  "description": "Answer customers on phone, WhatsApp, and SMS. Route conversations to the right AI or human agent, then use call insights to train and prepare your team.",
  "html": "<main id=\"main-content\" class=\"section about-content\">\n  \n  <nav class=\"suite-jump\" aria-label=\"Product suite navigation\"><a href=\"/product-suite.html\" aria-current=\"page\">Product suite</a><a href=\"/calling-and-routing.html\">Calling and routing</a><a href=\"/training-and-security.html\">Training and security</a><a href=\"/industry-and-rollout.html\">Industries and rollout</a><a href=\"/integrations-and-data.html\">Integrations and data</a><a href=\"/blogs/\">Blog</a><a class=\"nav-contact\" href=\"/contact/\">Contact</a></nav>\n  <div class=\"product-page-hero\">\n  <div class=\"product-page-intro\">\n    <span class=\"product-icon\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"/assets/icons/chart.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n    <h1>Explore the RoboRingo product suite</h1>\n  <p>Answer customers on phone, WhatsApp, and SMS. Route conversations to the right AI or human agent, then use call insights to train and prepare your team.</p>\n  </div>\n  <figure class=\"product-page-image\"><img src=\"/assets/images/industries-collage.jpg\" alt=\"Teams across healthcare, hospitality, retail, and logistics\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1672\" height=\"941\"></figure>\n</div>\n  <div class=\"suite-page-grid\"><article><figure class=\"product-page-image suite-card-image\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 836 470\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"An agent talking with a customer\"><image href=\"/assets/images/module-scenes.jpg\" width=\"1672\" height=\"941\"/></svg></figure><span class=\"product-icon\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"/assets/icons/phone.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><h2><a href=\"/calling-and-routing.html\">Calling and routing</a></h2><p>See how inbound and outbound conversations reach the right agent and update your systems.</p></article><article><figure class=\"product-page-image suite-card-image\"><svg viewBox=\"0 470 836 470\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Two teammates practising a conversation\"><image href=\"/assets/images/module-scenes.jpg\" width=\"1672\" height=\"941\"/></svg></figure><span class=\"product-icon\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"/assets/icons/shield.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><h2><a href=\"/training-and-security.html\">Training and security</a></h2><p>Follow the coaching and certification loop, explore approved simulations, and see how digital twins fit.</p></article><article><figure class=\"product-page-image suite-card-image\"><img src=\"/assets/images/industries-business.jpg\" alt=\"Teams in four industries\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1672\" height=\"941\"></figure><span class=\"product-icon\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"/assets/icons/check.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><h2><a href=\"/industry-and-rollout.html\">Industries and rollout</a></h2><p>Review industry workflows, supported languages, data handling, and what to bring to the rollout.</p></article><article><figure class=\"product-page-image suite-card-image\"><img src=\"/assets/images/conversation-context.jpg\" alt=\"Colleagues using a phone and laptop at work\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1672\" height=\"941\"></figure><span class=\"product-icon\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"/assets/icons/chart.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><h2><a href=\"/integrations-and-data.html\">Integrations and data</a></h2><p>See what agents can read and update, what appears in the dashboard, and how branding and data are handled.</p></article></div>\n  <div class=\"suite-actions suite-page-actions\">\n    <a class=\"primary\" href=\"tel:+918065590741\">Call the live demo \u00b7 +91 80 6559 0741</a>\n    <a class=\"suite-link\" href=\"/contact/\">Discuss your rollout</a>\n  </div>\n</main>",
